<title>USA: Utah Bonanza 400 MW coal unit at 75 pct power.</title>
<headline>Utah Bonanza 400 MW coal unit at 75 pct power.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 400 megawatt (MW) Bonanza coal-fired power plant at Vernal, Utah, is operating at 75 percent power and is expected to reach full power by the end of the day, sources familiar with the plant's operations said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The plant was shut on Saturday due to a tube leak.</p>
<p>The Bonanza plant is operated by the Desert Generation and Transmission Cooperative.</p>
<p>((--Los Angeles bureau + 1 213 955 6761))</p>
